  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">卡比為 HAL 實驗室與任天堂所有，我不居功。</span></h1><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><em><strong><strong><em><u>快去購買他們的遊戲！</u></em></strong></strong></em></span></h4><strong>此模組已停止更新</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkirby-mod-remorphed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">新模組在此！</a><h2><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:18px\"><strong>現已上架 Modrinth</strong></span></span></h2><h4><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:12px\"><strong>（Modrinth 上的模組更新將優先於 CurseForge）</strong></span>&nbsp;</h4><hr><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/633995/description_6fdf7c01-c567-453e-9f4b-7c8142975f93.png\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#f9c\">卡比</span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">模組展示</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#236fa1\">技術支援 Discord 伺服器&nbsp;:&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://discord.gg/rHY99gjbJV\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/rHY99gjbJV</a></span><hr><h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#2dc26b\">致謝</span></h5><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/foreverkirby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/c/foreverkirby</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/BestGamingSoundEffects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gamer's Paradise - YouTube</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/KirbyPeachfan39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hoppy Jr.</a><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#000\">-感謝 Funlax 允許我將 Amphibia 加入 Warpstar 可抵達的地點清單。</span>&nbsp;</span><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">-所有音樂曲目及音效均由 HAL 與任天堂製作。</span></strong></h3><hr>",
